    <!-- about us section -->
    <string name="about_us_content">
        We’re here to make cooking simpler and more joyful. Designed for home cooks, meal preppers, and food lovers, our app streamlines meal planning, recipe organizing, and grocery shopping—all in one place.\n\n
        We’re a team of food enthusiasts and tech minds who believe cooking should be creative, not chaotic. Let’s turn everyday meals into shared moments.\n\n
        <i>Simplify. Cook. Connect.</i>
    </string>

